<div class="our-testimonials light-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row section-row align-items-end">
      <div class="col-xl-6">
        <!-- Section Title Start -->
        <div class="section-title">
          <span class="section-sub-title wow fadeInUp">Customer reviews</span>
          <h2 class="text-anime-style-3" data-cursor="-opaque">
            What Our Customers Are Saying About Us
          </h2>
        </div>
        <!-- Section Title End -->
      </div>

      <div class="col-xl-6">
        <!-- Section Content Btn Start -->
        <div class="section-content-btn">
          <!-- Section Title Content Start -->
          <div class="section-title-content wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.2s">
            <p>
              Hear from our happy customers who trust us for natural healing,
              quality botanicals, and dependable service on their wellness
              journey.
            </p>
          </div>
          <!-- Section Title Content End -->

          <!-- Section Button Start -->
          <div class="section-btn wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.4s">
            <a class="btn-default" href="testimonials.html">View All reviews</a>
          </div>
          <!-- Section Button End -->
        </div>
        <!-- Section Content Btn End -->
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-xl-12">
        <!-- Testimonial Slider Start -->
        <div class="testimonial-slider">
          <div class="swiper">
            <div class="swiper-wrapper" data-cursor-text="Drag">
              <!-- Testimonial Slider Start -->
              <div class="swiper-slide">
                <!-- Testimonial Item Start -->
                <div class="testimonial-item">
                  <div class="testimonial-item-rating">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="testimonial-item-body">
                    <div class="testimonial-item-content">
                      <p>
                        “I've been using Vaya-Leaf's Moringa powder for three
                        months now, and the difference in my energy levels is
                        incredible. As someone who practices yoga daily, having
                        a pure, chemical-free supplement I can trust means
                        everything. The packaging is beautiful, and delivery to
                        Pune was faster than expected!”
                      </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="testimonial-author-box">
                      <div class="testimonial-author-image">
                        <figure class="image-anime">
                          <img src="/images/author-1.jpg" alt="" />
                        </figure>
                      </div>
                      <div class="testimonial-author-content">
                        <h2>Priya Sharma</h2>
                        <p>Yoga Instructor, Pune</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Testimonial Item End -->
              </div>
              <!-- Testimonial Slider Start -->

              <!-- Testimonial Slider Start -->
              <div class="swiper-slide">
                <!-- Testimonial Item Start -->
                <div class="testimonial-item">
                  <div class="testimonial-item-rating">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
                  </div>
                  <div class="testimonial-item-body">
                    <div class="testimonial-item-content">
                      <p>
                        “After trying countless brands, I finally found
                        Vaya-Leaf. Their Herbal supplements have become a
                        non-negotiable part of my morning routine. My immunity
                        has noticeably improved, and I love knowing exactly what
                        I'm putting into my body. My whole family now uses their
                        products.”
                      </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="testimonial-author-box">
                      <div class="testimonial-author-image">
                        <figure class="image-anime">
                          <img src="/images/author-2.jpg" alt="" />
